  <h2>Progression Strategies</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Increase work time by 5-10 seconds per exercise</li>
    <li>Reduce rest periods by 5 seconds</li>
    <li>Add rounds (start with 1, work to 3)</li>
    <li>Increase difficulty of each exercise variation</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Nutrition Connection</h2>
